// Package repository provides storage for the Kite instrument catalog and
// instrument lists.
//
// NewInstrumentsDuckDBRepository opens a persistent kite.InstrumentRepository. Its database
// path must be new or point to a catalog previously created by NewInstrumentsDuckDBRepository.
// Attach it with kite.Client.SetInstrumentRepository.
//
// The same database also stores instrument lists (CreateList, GetLists,
// ReplaceAutoGeneratedList, ...) in the list_metadata and list_items tables.
package repository
